inating symbiosis. The son, a well‑known photographer Bernard ben Dobrowolski, is lying in bed  because a chronic condition has deformed his body and immobilized him. The father, Dominik, has recently suffered from a stroke. Now they are taking care of each other and crowds of visitors move through their room.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":272616,\"title\":\"Journey Around My Room\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uSzFiKtEFVeGPhazFuK7Qg7nXNk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gUN3DPHZ8CaYd1KBLyW1U7WdFQ7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The camera slowly pans through a room as Smolders offers various observations and memories.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":841820,\"title\":\"Vowellet - An Essay by Sarah Vowell\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pFDoqhYbh1EASLVUrzaxv3amFy8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/38ie76777S0m5fXsI4fatEkkoqj.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This Pixar documentary short follows Sarah Vowell, who plays herself as the title character, on why she is a superhero in her own way. (This short piece is included on the 2-Disc DVD for \\\"The Incredibles\\\", which was released in 2005.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"Xp0s3t1ie7g\",\"name\":\"A Demonstration | Trailer | Berlinale 2020\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}